# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:4
translate kr palam_sewer_2a5939df:

    # "Following Sister Divine, we headed down into the bowels of the tower."
    "디바인 수녀를 따라, 우리는 탑의 깊은 곳으로 내려갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:5
translate kr palam_sewer_cad52b41:

    # "Every so often, as we descended the long, winding and increasingly dark staircases lit only by flickering torchlight, we’d hear a loud thump followed by the vibrating of the tower."
    "깜빡이는 횃불만이 비추는 길고 구불구불하고 점점 더 어두워지는 계단을 내려가는 동안, 이따금 굉음과 함께 탑이 진동하는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:10
translate kr palam_sewer_f7814228:

    # MC @ talk "What was that?"
    MC @ talk "뭐였지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:11
translate kr palam_sewer_9d82aa79:

    # DIVINE "I know not... It only began after we closed off the Sub-Basement following the incident."
    DIVINE "나도 몰라요... 사건 이후 지하실을 봉쇄한 후에야 시작됐어요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:12
translate kr palam_sewer_8ef5b3e2:

    # MC @ talk "... Hmm."
    MC @ talk "... 흠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:13
translate kr palam_sewer_d0d77fa0:

    # "At the bottom level of the dark and dreary tower, I was led towards a vault like oval door, sealed by a glowing blue aura that pulsated and acted as a barrier to keep whatever was on the other side trapped."
    "어둡고 음침한 탑의 맨 아래층에서, 나는 타원형 금고 문 같은 곳으로 안내되었다. 반대편에 있는 무언가를 가두기 위해 고동치는 푸른 오라가 봉인 역할을 하고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:14
translate kr palam_sewer_c433ed2a:

    # "Lightly touching its surface with my finger, I felt a zap of pain course through me."
    "손가락으로 표면을 살짝 만지자, 통증이 찌릿하고 흘렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:15
translate kr palam_sewer_dac17ae4:

    # MC @ surprised "Ah!"
    MC @ surprised "앗!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:16
translate kr palam_sewer_6066cd54:

    # DIVINE "This is the best we could do in the meanwhile."
    DIVINE "지금으로선 이게 최선이에요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:17
translate kr palam_sewer_477e7002:

    # DIVINE "We heard a few screams from those still trapped inside but... we haven’t heard any for a while now."
    DIVINE "아직 안에 갇힌 사람들로부터 비명 몇 번 들렸는데... 한동안 아무 소리도 안 들려요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:18
translate kr palam_sewer_44f83648:

    # "With a swipe of her hand, the glowing blue began to dissipate, and the opening into the darkness was now clear."
    "그녀가 손을 휘두르자, 빛나는 푸른빛이 흩어지기 시작했고, 어둠 속으로의 입구가 이제 열렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:19
translate kr palam_sewer_8c222c78:

    # DIVINE "Be careful in there..."
    DIVINE "조심하세요..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:20
translate kr palam_sewer_2678af05:

    # MC @ talk "Is there no one to assist me?"
    MC @ talk "날 도와줄 사람은 없나요?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:21
translate kr palam_sewer_6a99a3f3:

    # DIVINE "I cannot risk any more of our own."
    DIVINE "더 이상 우리 사람들을 위험에 빠뜨릴 수 없어요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:22
translate kr palam_sewer_439ea3b0:

    # DIVINE "Good luck to you."
    DIVINE "행운을 빌어요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:24
translate kr palam_sewer_86213208:

    # MC @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Here goes nothing..."
    MC @ talk "{i}*한숨*{/i} 에라 모르겠다..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:27
translate kr palam_sewer_de061c7f:

    # "Stepping into the vault, the blue shield once again rose from behind, trapping me inside the dark forsaken caverns of the Palam Tower."
    "금고 안으로 들어서자, 푸른 방패가 다시 뒤에서 올라와 나를 팔람 탑의 어둡고 버려진 동굴 안에 가두었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:28
translate kr palam_sewer_d3a550c9:

    # MC "Why did I agree to this? This was a terrible idea."
    MC "내가 왜 이걸 동의했지? 정말 끔찍한 생각이었어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:29
translate kr palam_sewer_6f415419:

    # MC "Alright... I guess I better head further inside and then change when I’m out of sight of Divine."
    MC "좋아... 더 안쪽으로 들어가서 디바인이 안 보일 때 변신하는 게 낫겠지."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:30
translate kr palam_sewer_fc2d2f23:

    # MC "Hopefully I won’t get eaten before then..."
    MC "그전에 잡아먹히지 않길 바라야지..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:33
translate kr palam_sewer_4876225d:

    # "Down in the depths of the Sub-Basement, I transformed into my ‘other’ form."
    "지하실 깊은 곳에서, 나는 나의 ‘다른’ 형태로 변신했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:37
translate kr palam_sewer_a87a791a:

    # "It was damp and cold down here, a place the mages rarely trod unless performing the most dangerous of spells."
    "여기는 축축하고 추웠다. 가장 위험한 주문을 수행할 때가 아니면 마법사들도 거의 발을 들이지 않는 곳이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:38
translate kr palam_sewer_748a18cd:

    # "I could see better once transformed, through a red tint I could make out shapes, the tiled ground and more as I patrolled through the eerily quiet halls."
    "변신하자 더 잘 보였다. 붉은 색조 너머로 형태들, 타일 바닥과 더 많은 것들을 구분할 수 있었고, 으스스하게 조용한 복도를 순찰했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:39
translate kr palam_sewer_bc98682c:

    # "Every so often I’d find a body or two, poor unlucky souls who had failed to make it out in time."
    "이따금 시체 하나둘을 발견했다. 제때 빠져나가지 못한 불운한 영혼들이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:40
translate kr palam_sewer_927ac599:

    # "They were mangled with flies crawling around the old, now festering wounds."
    "그들은 훼손되어 있었고, 파리들이 오래되고 곪아가는 상처 주위를 기어 다녔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:41
translate kr palam_sewer_9f79d839:

    # "Dried blood stained the walls, and as I inspected the wounds, I wondered what sort of creature could have done this?"
    "말라붙은 피가 벽을 얼룩졌고, 상처를 살피면서 나는 도대체 어떤 생명체가 이런 짓을 할 수 있었을지 궁금했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:42
translate kr palam_sewer_98510b84:

    # "As I smelt the air, something wretched and rotten drew me deeper into the labyrinthine tunnels of the Sub-Basement."
    "공기 냄새를 맡자, 어떤 비참하고 썩은 냄새가 나를 지하실의 미궁 같은 터널 더 깊은 곳으로 이끌었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:43
translate kr palam_sewer_366e166c:

    # "Finally, I arrived upon what seemed to be the site of the summoning, the white chalk now stained with dried blood splatters as corpses littered around the room had been moved and piled up into a decaying mound of death."
    "마침내 소환 의식이 있었던 장소로 보이는 곳에 도착했다. 흰 분필은 말라붙은 핏자국으로 얼룩져 있었고, 방 안에 흩어져 있던 시체들은 옮겨져 부패하는 죽음의 둔덕으로 쌓여 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:44
translate kr palam_sewer_005bb15e:

    # "From the small signs of struggle, it had been a massacre in here."
    "작은 저항의 흔적들로 보아, 이곳은 학살의 현장이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:45
translate kr palam_sewer_cbd77677:

    # "Inexperienced mages conjuring up something beyond what they could possibly hope to control..."
    "통제할 수 있을 거라고 기대할 수조차 없는 무언가를 소환한 미숙한 마법사들..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:46
translate kr palam_sewer_4fef6a9e:

    # "We had heard of such stories before but... seeing the result up close and personal was one of the more horrifying things I’d had to bear witness to."
    "그런 이야기를 전에 들은 적은 있었지만... 결과를 가까이서 직접 보는 건 내가 목격한 것 중 가장 끔찍한 일 중 하나였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:47
translate kr palam_sewer_a449b1e2:

    # "Suddenly, a loud rumbling sound could be heard as a rhythmic stomping seemed to shake the walls around me."
    "갑자기, 리듬감 있는 발구름 소리가 주변 벽을 흔드는 듯한 큰 우르릉거리는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:48
translate kr palam_sewer_98ad3b39:

    # "Looking towards one of the dark halls leading out, I could hear the thing coming closer towards me."
    "나가는 어두운 복도 중 하나를 바라보며, 무언가 나에게 다가오는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:49
translate kr palam_sewer_8bb109c5:

    # "Hiding behind a pillar, I waited and watched for whatever was approaching from the shadows."
    "기둥 뒤에 숨어, 그림자 속에서 다가오는 그 무엇이든 기다리며 지켜봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:53
translate kr palam_sewer_279cdf3c:

    # "Appearing through the darkness, a giant green frog-like creature sprung its way forward."
    "어둠 속에서 나타난 거대한 녹색 개구리 같은 생명체가 앞으로 튀어 나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:54
translate kr palam_sewer_72148ff0:

    # "It’s eyes blinking independently of one another as it looked around at the many corpses on the floor."
    "눈이 서로 독립적으로 깜빡이며 바닥의 많은 시체들을 둘러봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:55
translate kr palam_sewer_478bfa2b:

    # "Its tongue snapped out, grabbing one of the decaying bodies before lurching it into its mouth."
    "혀가 튀어 나와 부패하는 시체 하나를 낚아챈 뒤, 입 안으로 휙 집어넣었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:56
translate kr palam_sewer_0d31b390:

    # "Its razor teeth chomped down, gnawing at the bones which snapped with the movement of its jaws."
    "면도날 같은 이빨이 우물거리며, 턱의 움직임에 뼈가 부러지는 소리가 났다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:57
translate kr palam_sewer_b6e494ab:

    # "Hideous to behold, the creature smelled of some deep rot and mould as its mouth dripped old blood from the corpse it chewed."
    "보기에도 끔찍한 그 생명체는 깊은 부패와 곰팡이 냄새를 풍겼고, 씹고 있는 시체의 오래된 피가 입에서 뚝뚝 떨어졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:58
translate kr palam_sewer_ebdaed43:

    # "Its back was covered in thick black and sickly yellow spikes that seemed to tingle with the cold air, as if sensing for the slightest vibrations."
    "등은 차가운 공기에 찌릿거리는 듯한 두꺼운 검은색과 병든 노란색 가시로 덮여 있었고, 마치 미세한 진동이라도 감지하는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:59
translate kr palam_sewer_e0db2096:

    # "Suddenly, the thing stopped chewing... Letting the mangled body roll out of its mouth and slip almost comically to the floor, it raised its snout and sniffed into the air, taking deep guttural breaths."
    "갑자기, 그 녀석이 씹는 것을 멈췄다... 훼손된 시체가 입에서 굴러나와 거의 우스꽝스러울 정도로 바닥에 미끄러지자, 주둥이를 들고 공기를 킁킁거리며 깊고 목구멍 깊은 숨을 들이쉬었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:60
translate kr palam_sewer_b8f57e6b:

    # MC "... Does it know I’m here?"
    MC "... 내가 여기 있는 걸 아는 건가?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:61
translate kr palam_sewer_e365d7bb:

    # "Suddenly, its tongue lashed out, tearing away the pillar I was hiding behind!"
    "갑자기, 혀가 휘둘러져 내가 숨어 있던 기둥을 찢어발겼다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:62
translate kr palam_sewer_5dc3baef:

    # MC "...!"
    MC "...!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:63
translate kr palam_sewer_119abfd8:

    # MC "Well, I guess that answers that!"
    MC "음, 그걸로 답은 나왔네!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:64
translate kr palam_sewer_2cc0083f:

    # MC "There’s no choice now!"
    MC "이제 선택의 여지가 없어!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:78
translate kr palam_sewer_e70f4666:

    # "As the thing weaved drowsily back and forth, blood seeping from its wounds and mouth, it heaved and shuddered before collapsing onto its side."
    "그것이 졸린 듯 비틀거리며 앞뒤로 흔들리고, 상처와 입에서 피가 흘러나오다가, 숨을 깊게 들이쉬고 몸을 떤 후 옆으로 쓰러졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:79
translate kr palam_sewer_983f46aa:

    # "Its tongue flopped in defeat as it took one last long ragged breath, inflating its stomach before it simply fizzled out in a slow, pitiful death."
    "패배한 듯 혀가 축 늘어졌고, 마지막으로 길고 거친 숨을 한 번 들이쉬며 배를 부풀렸다가, 서서히 가엾은 죽음을 맞으며 숨이 멎었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:80
translate kr palam_sewer_66fc34db:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Where did that thing come from?"
    MC "{i}*헉*{/i} 저건 대체 어디서 온 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:81
translate kr palam_sewer_e39751b3:

    # BLACK "This creature has proven formidable... We should consider training to enhance our combat abilities further should other predators arrive."
    BLACK "이 생명체는 강력했어... 다른 포식자가 나타날 경우를 대비해 전투 능력을 더 강화할 훈련을 고려해야 해."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:82
translate kr palam_sewer_7ae248df:

    # MC "Ha, thanks for the tip, captain obv—"
    MC "하, 조언 고마워, 캡틴 뻔—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:84
translate kr palam_sewer_e4b6b435:

    # "The tongue suddenly lashed out, wrapping around my ankle as it tripped me up onto the cold, wet floor."
    "혀가 갑자기 튀어 나와 내 발목을 감싸며 나를 차갑고 젖은 바닥에 넘어뜨렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:85
translate kr palam_sewer_d28c61d4:

    # MC "SHIT!"
    MC "젠장!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:86
translate kr palam_sewer_e8a960a5:

    # "Dragging me towards its gaping maw of a mouth, I glared at the dozen or so razor teeth waiting to gnash and grind my bones, one desperate last meal for a dying beast."
    "나를 벌어진 입 쪽으로 끌고 가면서, 죽어가는 짐승의 마지막 절박한 한 끼를 위해 내 뼈를 갈아 으스러뜨릴 준비가 된 수십 개의 날카로운 이빨을 노려봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:89
translate kr palam_sewer_65c814be:

    # "Just before it's jaws landed on me, a sparkling blast of magic energy hit the beast."
    "턱이 나에게 닿기 직전, 반짝이는 마법 에너지 폭발이 그 짐승을 강타했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:91
translate kr palam_sewer_182917d6:

    # "The monster wailed and cried out desperately."
    "괴물은 울부짖으며 필사적으로 비명을 질렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:92
translate kr palam_sewer_b4926bc7:

    # "Finally, it dropped to the floor motionless, and the thing’s eyes rolled deathly white as it lay still again."
    "마침내, 바닥에 움직임 없이 떨어졌고, 그 녀석의 눈이 죽은 듯 하얗게 뒤집혀 다시 움직이지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:98
translate kr palam_sewer_f0470a4e:

    # "Stood above me was Divine who flung her blade aside and smiled."
    "내 위에는 디바인이 서서 검을 옆으로 버리고 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:99
translate kr palam_sewer_02934deb:

    # DIVINE "{i}I knew it...{/i}"
    DIVINE "{i}알고 있었어요...{/i}"

