    # DIVINE "{i}You{/i} smell unlike anything I have ever encountered before."
    DIVINE "{i}당신은{/i} 내가 이제껏 만나본 어떤 것과도 다른 냄새가 나요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:116
translate kr palam_sewer_063f888a:

    # DIVINE "I knew there was something different about you the moment I laid eyes on you."
    DIVINE "당신을 처음 본 순간부터 뭔가 다르다는 걸 알았어요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:117
