# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:120
translate kr palam_sewer_95efb4e4:

    # DIVINE "Your secret is safe with me."
    DIVINE "당신의 비밀은 나와 함께 안전해요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:121
translate kr palam_sewer_e1b0c1cb:

    # DIVINE "I can think of {i}so{/i} many other things I’d rather do with you..."
    DIVINE "당신과 차라리 하고 싶은 {i}수많은{/i} 다른 일들이 머릿속에 떠올라요..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:123
translate kr palam_sewer_692b0afe:

    # "Sister Divine stepped forward alluringly, her hands resting over the hard exoskeleton of my chest."
    "디바인 수녀가 유혹적으로 다가와, 내 가슴의 단단한 외골격 위에 손을 올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:124
translate kr palam_sewer_4b59b47b:

    # MC "Uhh... Are you—"
    MC "어... 설마—"

