    MC "그러니까—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:146
translate kr palam_sewer_9fec17fd:

    # DIVINE "We prefer our mages handle their dalliances with... discretion."
    DIVINE "우리 마법사들은 그들의 연애를... 신중하게 처리하는 걸 선호해요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:147
translate kr palam_sewer_9eecb9f4:

    # DIVINE "This way suits both our needs."
    DIVINE "이쪽이 우리 둘 다에게 맞아요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:149
translate kr palam_sewer_d11b242a:

    # "With that, Sister Divine turned to leave the basement while I followed in her wake."
    "그러고 나서, 디바인 수녀는 지하실을 떠나려 돌아섰고 나는 그 뒤를 따랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:150
translate kr palam_sewer_e2dda61b:

    # DIVINE "Come, this way..."
    DIVINE "자, 이쪽으로..."

