    # "As I changed back into my human form, Divine remarked I should get dressed before making my way out of the basement, scrambling to locate the clothes I had left on my way in, we finally returned to the main halls of the tower."
    "인간 형태로 돌아오자, 디바인은 지하실을 나가기 전에 옷을 입어야 한다고 말했다. 들어올 때 벗어둔 옷을 찾아 허둥지둥하며, 우리는 마침내 탑의 메인 홀로 돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:157
translate kr palam_sewer_a205ebc7:

    # DIVINE "Hmm... A shame."
    DIVINE "흠... 아쉽네요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:158
translate kr palam_sewer_d3c2fa0e:

    # DIVINE "Then I guess our business has concluded."
    DIVINE "그럼 우리 일은 끝난 것 같군요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:159
translate kr palam_sewer_d6c70b13:

    # DIVINE "Come, I will escort you out."
    DIVINE "오세요, 밖으로 안내해 드릴게요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:160
translate kr palam_sewer_f19eb997:

    # "In her hands, a glowing blue ball began to form, lighting the way back for us as I followed behind."
    "그녀의 손에서 빛나는 푸른 구체가 형성되기 시작하며, 내가 뒤를 따르는 동안 돌아가는 길을 밝혀줬다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:161
translate kr palam_sewer_e7a9b781:

    # "I sensed the disappointment in Divine’s voice, but decided it was probably best to keep my mouth shut."
    "나는 디바인의 목소리에서 실망감을 느꼈지만, 입을 다무는 게 최선일 거라고 판단했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:163
translate kr palam_sewer_48b7803c:

    # "As I changed back into my human form, Divine remarked I should get dressed before making my way out of the basement."
    "인간 형태로 돌아오자, 디바인은 지하실을 나가기 전에 옷을 입어야 한다고 말했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:164
translate kr palam_sewer_ced1a217:

    # "I scrambled to gather up the clothes I has abandoned on my way in and we finally returned to the main halls of the tower."
    "들어올 때 버려둔 옷을 급히 주워 모으고, 우리는 마침내 탑의 메인 홀로 돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:169
translate kr palam_sewer_fac7386c:

    # DIVINE "I thank you for your services to the Goddess Palam."
    DIVINE "팔람 여신을 위한 당신의 봉사에 감사드려요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:170
translate kr palam_sewer_4bc02166:

    # MC @ talk "Anytime... Although I hope that next time it won’t be so quite so dangerous."
    MC @ talk "언제든지요... 하지만 다음에는 이렇게 위험하지 않았으면 좋겠네요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:172
translate kr palam_sewer_39656a81:

    # "Sister Divine smiled, holding out the crystal for me to take."
    "디바인 수녀가 미소 지으며, 내가 가져가도록 크리스탈을 내밀었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:175
translate kr palam_sewer_8194abb6:

    # DIVINE "It’s all yours."
    DIVINE "다 네 거예요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:176
translate kr palam_sewer_29d31280:

    # MC @ talk "Glad to be of service."
    MC @ talk "도움이 되어 기쁩니다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:178
translate kr palam_sewer_3797aa16:

    # DIVINE "I look forward to our next meeting..."
    DIVINE "다음 만남이 기대되네요..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:180
translate kr palam_sewer_2837592b:

    # DIVINE "Of course."
    DIVINE "물론이죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/HighFashion/frog_sewer.rpy:181
translate kr palam_sewer_8474a392:

    # DIVINE "Now, if you will excuse me..."
    DIVINE "그럼, 실례할게요..."

